    "body": "Thanks, looks like I accidentally deleted `internal priority` instead of priority from the copy step.  Should be fixed now.\r\n\r\nI also added a step 27 to the constructor to take init's `priority` into account in setting `internal priority` (I don't think we can be more specific than that for how each browser will choose to modify or override an existing `internal priority`).",
