    "updated_at": "2022-12-14T17:28:23Z",
    "body": "IDL files in WPT come from https://github.com/w3c/webref, and there's a consistency check that runs before releasing `@webref/idl`. In other words, you don't need to worry about a two-sided spec change making the sum of all IDL inconsistent for a period. Ideally that only lasts for a few days, but a broken set of IDL won't be imported into WPT.\r\n\r\nHope that helps?",
